    "body": "I don't necessarily agree we want to standardize on that. The whole idea is to be able to wrap at a certain amount of characters so you get monospace-compatible wrapping. Making it depend on the width and font in use just makes the whole thing unreliable. Granted, it already is, but then if we don't want to do what it was designed for I'd rather just remove it.",
